{"ts":"2026-08-24T14:27:59.779Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"db5a07f20823865f5ed7d07d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":{"value":"release-operator","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","release:pm-h6b73t"]},"topic":{"value":"pm-a8zm","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-a8zm","release:pm-h6b73t"]}},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-24T14:27:59.779Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-24T14:27:59.779Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Continuity programme organization 2026-08-24: durability is evaluated across independent axes rather than as one distant date. Format continuity is owned by the open workspace specification and conformance suite; state continuity by item and workspace point-in-time reconstruction; proof continuity by algorithm-agile chains and portable detached attestations; semantic continuity by versioned relationship and operation vocabularies; organizational continuity by federation, signatures, and policy migration; legal continuity by retention and proof-preserving erasure; consumer continuity by re-derivable token and latency budgets. Added explicit verifies edges from pm-4jk8kx, pm-3z0k, and pm-5gf0xf to this outcome; pm-pae3wo already verifies it. Promotion requires a synthetic corpus spanning multiple format, schema, policy, organization, and cryptographic generations plus independent-reader proof. No additional calendar milestone is needed because this item already owns the multi-decade outcome."}]}],"before_hash":"91db15a5fec66ae5e7ab7988fd663aceb0a816ba80285098517a4cf17096506c","after_hash":"bebe0e96450a5c0aaa6d9d208ef1cffff51a995a04a043b06f4922fa4a3